<title>POLAND: VISTULA JAN NET RISES TO PLN 1.22 MLN.</title>
<headline>VISTULA JAN NET RISES TO PLN 1.22 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results January</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>JANUARY</p>
<p> Net profit	     1.22 vs   1.10</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 1.99 vs   1.68</p>
<p> Operating profit     1.51 vs   1.46</p>
<p> Sales		   10.08 vs   8.03</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish garment maker is Vistula SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
